    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Contemporary Luxury Living with Breathtaking Water Views\r\n\r\nA superb opportunity to acquire a beautifully designed 156 sqm, NZEB-rated home, forming part of  the exclusive bespoke Carraig Mhor development of just 34 homes in a premium location on the outskirts of Wexford town centre.\r\n\r\nCombining contemporary architecture, luxurious finishes and energy-efficient design, this exceptional home has been thoughtfully planned to provide modern family living across three spacious floors all enjoying beautiful views in a prime setting.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor centres around a welcoming and cosy living room, together with an impressive kitchen / dining area that opens directly onto the enclosed garden, creating a wonderful connection between indoor and outdoor living. A convenient utility room and guest WC complete this level.\r\n\r\nOn the first floor, there are two generous double bedrooms, including a beautifully appointed en-suite main bedroom, together with a stylish family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe second floor provides a further two double bedrooms and a separate shower room. This level is particularly special, with breathtaking water views providing a stunning backdrop and creating a peaceful and uplifting atmosphere.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property benefits from a front driveway with private parking for two cars, complete with an electric vehicle charging point, while the enclosed garden offers a private, low-maintenance outdoor space to relax and enjoy.\r\n\r\nThe home is finished to an exceptionally high standard, with carefully selected fixtures, fittings and finishes throughout. Its NZEB energy rating further enhances the home’s efficiency, comfort and appeal, making it an ideal choice for modern living.\r\n\r\nIdeally located just minutes from Wexford town centre aprox. 1.7km, this is a rare opportunity to secure a brand-new, ready-to-move-into home within an intimate and thoughtfully designed development.\r\n\r\nThe sale of this property offers a once off opportunity to acquire a luxury home in an ideal location."
      },
      {
