        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation Comprises:\r\nHouse Type G2 – 4 Bedroom Detached 3 Floors c. 156 m2 / c. 1680 sq ft\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway\r\nKitchen/Diner\r\nLiving Room\r\nGuest WC\r\nPantry\r\nFirst Floor\r\nLanding\r\n2 Bedroom\r\n1 En-Suite\r\nBathroom\r\nSecond Floor\r\nLanding\r\n2 Bedroom\r\nBathroom\r\n\r\nRegister your interest now…. email  edel@keaneauctioneers.com\r\n\r\nApply: Keane Auctioneers (053) 9123072\r\nViewing: Strictly by appointment with the sole selling agent."
