        "Content": "Property Features:\r\n156 sqm approximately.\r\nNZEB energy rating.\r\nFour double bedrooms.\r\nMain bedroom with en-suite.\r\nFamily bathroom and separate shower room.\r\nContemporary kitchen/dining room opening onto garden.\r\nCosy living room.\r\nUtility room and guest WC.\r\nEnclosed, low-maintenance garden.\r\nPrivate front driveway with parking for two cars.\r\nElectric vehicle charging point.\r\nLuxury design and high-quality finishes throughout.\r\nExclusive bespoke development of only 34 homes.\r\nMinutes from Wexford town centre.\r\nReady to move into."
